[PRIO] api.signageos.io/v2/*: 6.65 (attack=7, business=8, tech=7, gate=10, cloud=7, fresh=7) — Partial v2 migration; /v2/device JWT-gated but /v2/account, /v2/organization 404; authz drift candidate, PASSIVE testable  
